<title>USA: Southern Union Co sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Southern Union Co sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southern Union Co said Wednesday it had declared a five percent stock dividend, payable December 10, record November 22.</p>
<p>Cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares, it said.</p>
</text>
